# Copy to .env and fill in to enable TypeSafe AI.
#
# Two things read this key:
# - trading_hub.reasoning_layer (the legacy trend/mean_reversion/breakout
#   bots' market-regime classifier) - falls back to a local heuristic
#   without it.
# - trading_hub.jev_decision (the Jev AI Decision Bot itself) - without it,
#   Jev always HOLDs. This is intentional fail-safe behavior, not a bug:
#   "Jev unavailable -> HOLD" per the risk spec. Jev will not place any
#   trade until a real key is configured here.
#
# Never commit a real value. Never sent to the frontend/dashboard - it is
# read server-side only, by these two modules.
TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
